WEBVTT

00:03:58.763 --> 00:04:00.997
The underlying decentralized technology

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:04.130
that enabled digital currencies
such as Bitcoin

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.297
is blockchain.

00:04:05.863 --> 00:04:10.597
Blockchain prevents digital money
from being duplicated or hacked,

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:15.230
and it removes the need
for a centralized authority,

00:04:15.263 --> 00:04:17.130
such as a bank,

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.397
to validate transactions.

00:04:18.397 --> 00:04:23.697
And like Bitcoin, the record
of ownership of an NFT

00:04:23.697 --> 00:04:26.830
is kept in a public database
on the internet

00:04:26.863 --> 00:04:28.930
that is maintained
by millions of computers

00:04:28.963 --> 00:04:31.830
that keep track, via consensus,